# Browser Verification for UI Changes

When making changes to UI components, layout, or styles:

1. Ensure the dev server is running (`npm run dev` on port 3002)
2. Use MCP browser tools (cursor-ide-browser, Playwright, or Puppeteer) to navigate to http://localhost:3002
3. Take a full-page screenshot to visually verify the result
4. Use browser_snapshot to inspect DOM structure when needed
5. Check for layout issues (gaps, alignment, overflow, missing spaces)
6. If issues are found, fix and re-verify in the browser
